<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/coparticipation.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                    dcterms:description "Two or more objects co-participate in the same event."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                    dcterms:title "Co-Participation Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                    rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x2; term declared x2;
